+=================
+VK_VRCaptureDrawState
+
+overlay patch 0017 — the rasterised state of the draw about to be issued, read
+from the places that decide it rather than restated from the places that intend
+it. `mvpBound` is the push constant in flight; `mvpView` is what this view's own
+projection would produce at this instant. Equal is the healthy answer; different
+means a bind from earlier in the frame is still current, and the difference says
+which one.
+
+`depth_range` is the range the caller is ABOUT to pass to vk_draw_geometry, so
+the viewport reported is the one that draw will run under, not the one left over
+from the previous one. Costs one matrix multiply and is called at most twice per
+eye, from a dev-build diagnostic.
+=================
+*/
